  <Analysis>
    <Title>Groups - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[Provides information on the&nbsp;groups defined on the System
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>NOT in proxy agent context</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="1" Name="Groups - Users - Windows" EvaluationPeriod="P1D">((&quot;.&quot; &amp; following text of first (computer name) of (it as string)) | (it as string)) of members of local group &quot;Users&quot; as string</Property>
